# Build output
*.shell-extension.zip

# NOTE: locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.mo are shipped on purpose. They are compiled
# from po/ by `make`, but GNOME Shell loads them at runtime and most users
# install from a clone without running make, so they must stay in the tree.

# Compiled stylesheet is kept in the tree, but SASS temp files are not
*.css.map

